# The second script of the manual's screenshots, on a high-colour screen:
# two documents, each with a colour theme of its own (see manual/build.sh).
OPEN DEMO.RTF
CMD NEW
TYPE A second document.\nEach window can have a colour theme of its own.
CMD TILEH
THEMEDOC 13
CMD CYCLE
THEMEDOC 8
WAIT 2
SHOT themed
QUIT
